              and doubled the integration domain for convenience, and in the last step we used the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/trigonometric+identity"} trigonometric identity
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
